type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A single template token whose path resolves to the records.  An array
gives one tiddler per element.  An //object// is a single record, so
`{{}}` — the empty path, the document itself — makes one tiddler for the
whole document, and `{{book}}` one for a nested object; a profile that
needs both a tiddler for the whole thing and one per item is two
profiles over the same JSON (see
[[One tiddler for the document, one per item|$:/plugins/crosseye/json-convert-studio/usage/recipes/document-record]]).
Anything else — a string, a number, nothing — is `records-not-array`.  See [[Section 5|$:/plugins/crosseye/json-convert-studio/usage/paths]] for the path
syntax.
